...@../../_tools/theme
direction: down

visual_assessor: 1. 시각 분석 (VisualAssessor) { class: ours }
search_agent: 검색 에이전트 (SearchAgent) { class: ours }
util_tools: 보조 도구 (estimate_renovation_cost) { class: ours }
flash: gemini-3-flash-preview { class: ext }

visual_assessor -> flash: instruction + 도구 선언 + 사진
visual_assessor -> search_agent: AgentTool 호출-복귀
visual_assessor -> util_tools: estimate_renovation_cost 호출
search_agent -> flash: instruction + google_search 선언
